WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.366 --> 00:00:06.433
Move it, everyone. Let's really step on the gas.

2
00:00:06.833 --> 00:00:08.966
-He sure is acting weird.

3
00:00:09.466 --> 00:00:11.233
Yeah, normally he'd complain.

4
00:00:11.733 --> 00:00:13.500
I guess he's really excited.

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:16.533
We're going to an Electric-type celebration.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.933
It's Zapdos Festival!

7
00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:24.400
As an Electric-type Pokémon trainer, I've wanted to witness this great event.

8
00:00:24.933 --> 00:00:27.900
You see, long ago, a tree in the center of Joule Town

9
00:00:27.966 --> 00:00:31.000
was split by a bolt of lightning sent by Zapdos.

10
00:00:31.633 --> 00:00:35.500
But amazingly, the tree got larger and stronger,

11
00:00:35.566 --> 00:00:37.600
and became thick with berries.

12
00:00:37.666 --> 00:00:42.200
The townspeople were overjoyed, and they created the Zapdos Festival.

13
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.100
They did it with the hope that Zapdos would appear and bring the town good luck.

14
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:47.400
And that's the story.

15
00:00:47.466 --> 00:00:49.033
Uh, what's a Zapdos?

16
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.900
It's a powerful Pokémon who can control lightning.

17
00:00:52.600 --> 00:00:56.100
There's Moltres, the Flame Pokémon we saw with Trevor.

18
00:00:56.166 --> 00:00:58.733
And Articuno, the Freeze Pokémon.

19
00:00:58.933 --> 00:01:01.566
And finally, there's Zapdos.

20
00:01:02.433 --> 00:01:06.066
Together, they form a trio of Legendary Pokémon.

21
00:01:07.933 --> 00:01:10.666
Wow, three Legendary Pokémon.

22
00:01:10.733 --> 00:01:13.200
I'd just love to see them.

23
00:01:19.233 --> 00:01:21.666
- Zapdos.
- Wowee.

24
00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:23.500
I've never seen it before.

25
00:01:23.566 --> 00:01:25.966
That means Zapdos really has come back.

26
00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:32.433
- I got to see Zapdos. Mm-hm.
- Isn't it cool?

27
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.833
Hey, we can't just stand here. We gotta get moving.

28
00:01:37.400 --> 00:01:38.933
Hold on. What's the rush?

29
00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:43.333
If we don't make it to town by the time Zapdos arrives,

30
00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:46.233
I'm afraid we'll miss the festival's main event.

31
00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:57.900
-Hey, Clemont, are you all right?

32
00:01:58.733 --> 00:02:00.933
I'm okay, but that was close.

33
00:02:01.433 --> 00:02:02.733
- Huh?

34
00:02:07.466 --> 00:02:09.500
It sounds like Zapdos is angry.

35
00:02:09.566 --> 00:02:11.366
Yeah. I wonder what's wrong.

36
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.900
It's too dangerous to try to get to town now.

37
00:02:18.966 --> 00:02:21.566
We need to find shelter somewhere.

38
00:02:21.866 --> 00:02:23.266
I think I found a cave.

39
00:02:23.866 --> 00:02:26.333
Great. I think we should go quickly.

40
00:02:32.200 --> 00:02:35.966
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

41
00:02:36.033 --> 00:02:40.000
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

42
00:02:40.066 --> 00:02:43.200
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

43
00:02:43.266 --> 00:02:45.100
♪ Pokémon ♪

44
00:02:45.166 --> 00:02:47.566
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

45
00:02:47.633 --> 00:02:50.833
♪ I stand tall 'Cause I know I'm a winner ♪

46
00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.833
♪ Pokémon ♪

47
00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:55.700
- ♪ Pokémon ♪
- ♪ Gotta catch 'em all ♪

48
00:03:06.066 --> 00:03:08.133
While traveling to the Zapdos Festival,

49
00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:10.900
our heroes have actually encountered Zapdos.

50
00:03:10.966 --> 00:03:14.966
For their safety, they're now forced to seek shelter in a nearby cave.

51
00:03:17.333 --> 00:03:19.366
That was scary.

52
00:03:19.433 --> 00:03:22.233
I think we should be safe here for the time being.

53
00:03:23.266 --> 00:03:27.533
I still hope we can make it to Joule Town before the festival begins.

54
00:03:28.200 --> 00:03:30.266
You said Joule Town? Tell me.

55
00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:39.033
Wait! I didn't mean to scare you!

56
00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.200
I'm truly sorry about that.

57
00:03:42.633 --> 00:03:45.233
My name is Stan, and I'm a paramedic.

58
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:48.233
- What happened to your leg?
- Strange.

59
00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:51.500
It's ironic that a paramedic needs rescuing.

60
00:03:51.833 --> 00:03:56.033
I was driving in that crazy storm, when I had to make a sudden turn

61
00:03:56.333 --> 00:03:57.966
and crashed my ambulance.

62
00:04:09.266 --> 00:04:11.666
Oh, no. Are you badly hurt?

63
00:04:11.733 --> 00:04:14.300
No, I was able to patch myself up.

64
00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:18.100
But more importantly, there's something I really need to ask you.

65
00:04:18.166 --> 00:04:19.466
What can we do?

66
00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:24.333
Here. I need you to take this over to the hospital in town.

67
00:04:25.066 --> 00:04:27.366
There's a child waiting for this medicine.

68
00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:31.600
It needs to get there as soon as possible, but I'm in this condition.

69
00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:37.000
I'm sorry for having to ask, but if you could please do this for me.

70
00:04:37.866 --> 00:04:41.666
- We just need to get it to the hospital.
- Will you do it, guys?

71
00:04:42.133 --> 00:04:44.866
- Of course we will.
- Pika, Pika.

72
00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:50.300
But how can we get there with all that lightning going on?

73
00:04:50.366 --> 00:04:54.066
This cave used to have a direct connection straight into Joule Town,

74
00:04:54.133 --> 00:04:57.066
but now the only open route is outside.

75
00:04:58.133 --> 00:05:01.633
A long time ago, the cave was sealed off by a rockslide.

76
00:05:02.100 --> 00:05:05.066
- The route's been blocked ever since.
- No problem.

77
00:05:05.133 --> 00:05:07.633
- I'm glad you gave us a heads-up.
- You are?

78
00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.933
Hawlucha, I choose you!

79
00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.733
- Hawlucha.
- Hawlucha, quick.

80
00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:16.000
Use Karate Chop and smash that rock!

81
00:05:16.800 --> 00:05:20.500
Hawlucha!

82
00:05:23.166 --> 00:05:25.433
- Whoa.
- Way to go, Hawlucha.

83
00:05:25.500 --> 00:05:26.600
Pika!

84
00:05:27.133 --> 00:05:28.333
Hawlucha.

85
00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:30.200
Now, for the next step.

86
00:05:31.000 --> 00:05:32.733
Noibat, I choose you!

87
00:05:34.533 --> 00:05:35.366
Noibat.

88
00:05:36.100 --> 00:05:38.800
Use Supersonic to lead us through the cave.

89
00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:41.366
- We've gotta find the shortest route.
- Noibat.

90
00:05:41.833 --> 00:05:43.133
Braixen, let's go!

91
00:05:44.366 --> 00:05:46.966
- Braixen, go!
- I want you to make a flame

92
00:05:47.033 --> 00:05:49.000
- to give us some light.
- Braixen.

93
00:05:50.766 --> 00:05:52.666
Okay, then, we're off.

94
00:05:52.733 --> 00:05:55.700
We'll get help for you as soon as we get to town.

95
00:05:55.766 --> 00:05:57.700
Okay. Thanks a lot.

96
00:06:07.366 --> 00:06:09.666
- Noibat.
- Lucha, Lucha.

97
00:06:10.366 --> 00:06:12.433
All right, Noibat, see what's ahead.

98
00:06:20.966 --> 00:06:23.000
Noibat. Noi!

99
00:06:23.066 --> 00:06:24.400
Hawlucha.

100
00:06:24.466 --> 00:06:26.533
Okay, everybody, let's go.

101
00:06:26.866 --> 00:06:27.766
Pika.

102
00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:47.433
We've got one mad Zapdos on our hands. What do we do now?

103
00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:51.933
I didn't think catching that large lug was gonna be this big of a pain in the neck.

104
00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.533
Uh-oh. Time for round two.

105
00:06:55.733 --> 00:06:58.733
It's good to remember, offense is the best defense.

106
00:06:58.966 --> 00:07:02.300
- Keep attacking with that magnetic field.
- Ten-four.

107
00:07:09.366 --> 00:07:11.433
Our magnet's out of gas!

108
00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:20.133
- Move it, Meowth!
- Like lightning.

109
00:07:24.766 --> 00:07:27.800
The term "legendary" fits well.

110
00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.133
Noibat.

111
00:07:35.366 --> 00:07:36.633
- Pika, Pika!
- Huh?

112
00:07:37.733 --> 00:07:39.066
Noi!

113
00:07:39.133 --> 00:07:40.400
Noibat! Hey, look out!

114
00:07:46.033 --> 00:07:48.600
- Is everybody all right?
- Where's Ash?

115
00:07:48.666 --> 00:07:51.600
Huh? Ash! Noibat! Hawlucha!

116
00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:54.600
- We're all okay!
- Aw!

117
00:07:54.666 --> 00:07:55.900
How about you?

118
00:07:57.066 --> 00:07:59.233
Everybody's all right over here.

119
00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:01.166
That's a relief.

120
00:08:01.233 --> 00:08:02.533
-Huh?

121
00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:07.533
Hey, everything will be all right. Don't forget, we're right here with you.

122
00:08:08.000 --> 00:08:10.033
- Pikachu.
- Hawlucha.

123
00:08:10.366 --> 00:08:12.100
Noi. Noibat.

124
00:08:13.466 --> 00:08:16.033
Okay, you guys, we're gonna smash through.

125
00:08:19.233 --> 00:08:21.200
Wait a minute! Stop! Hawlucha!

126
00:08:21.666 --> 00:08:22.933
It's going to collapse!

127
00:08:24.933 --> 00:08:27.833
Ash, we'll take Stan and try to get to town.

128
00:08:29.266 --> 00:08:31.700
Remember, you've got that medicine to deliver.

129
00:08:31.766 --> 00:08:34.299
You'd better get to the hospital as soon as you can.

130
00:08:34.366 --> 00:08:36.133
That kid's depending on it.

131
00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.200
You're right. We're going now.

132
00:08:38.466 --> 00:08:39.400
- Pika.
- Hawlucha.

133
00:08:39.466 --> 00:08:42.766
Serena, promise me you guys will be careful, okay?

134
00:08:42.966 --> 00:08:43.933
Okay.

135
00:08:45.566 --> 00:08:46.900
Let's get out of here.

136
00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.100
- Noibat.
- Pika.

137
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:50.366
Hawlucha.

138
00:08:51.233 --> 00:08:52.266
Noibat.

139
00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:53.800
Noi!

140
00:08:56.233 --> 00:08:58.233
Who's that Pokémon?

141
00:09:03.366 --> 00:09:05.700
It's Zapdos!

142
00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.733
Not again.

143
00:09:21.433 --> 00:09:22.933
Ready, Noibat?

144
00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.233
Noibat.

145
00:09:30.866 --> 00:09:32.233
Which way do we go?

146
00:09:32.633 --> 00:09:33.733
Noi...

147
00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:42.166
Noibat.

148
00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:45.100
Noi! Noibat!

149
00:09:45.166 --> 00:09:47.233
It's that way. Move.

150
00:09:47.466 --> 00:09:49.100
- Pikachu.
- Hawlucha.

151
00:09:52.433 --> 00:09:53.266
Noibat.

152
00:09:54.866 --> 00:09:57.766
-You're doing great, Noibat.

153
00:09:57.833 --> 00:09:58.866
Noibat.

154
00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:26.900
It's Zapdos. What's going on?

155
00:10:30.366 --> 00:10:31.400
What was that?

156
00:10:31.733 --> 00:10:32.900
Pika.

157
00:10:33.433 --> 00:10:36.366
Us. We're preparing for trouble, too.

158
00:10:36.633 --> 00:10:39.366
And we're making it double, exactly like you.

159
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.433
Still, we're protecting the world from devastation.

160
00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:46.866
Still, we're uniting all people within our nation.

161
00:10:47.666 --> 00:10:50.400
To denounce the evils of bullying and fear.

162
00:10:50.466 --> 00:10:53.600
To extend that fear because the twerp is here.

163
00:10:54.166 --> 00:10:56.066
- Jesse.
- And James.

164
00:10:56.133 --> 00:10:59.600
Team Rocket blasts off with courage at the speed of light.

165
00:10:59.666 --> 00:11:03.100
Surrender now or prepare for a windswept, furious fight.

166
00:11:03.333 --> 00:11:05.366
It's Meowth. Okay, I'll bite.

167
00:11:05.433 --> 00:11:06.633
Team Rocket.

168
00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:10.866
Zapdos, give it a rest!

169
00:11:11.466 --> 00:11:14.466
- Team Rocket time-out!
- Enough! Whoa!

170
00:11:15.866 --> 00:11:17.133
Meowth, no!

171
00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:18.433
Oy vey.

172
00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:20.233
Huh?!

173
00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:25.966
All right, guys, what's going on here? You're up to no good again, aren't you?

174
00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.700
Honestly? Not this time.

175
00:11:29.166 --> 00:11:33.900
Here's the deal. We were planning on grabbing a Pokémon, as per usual.

176
00:11:39.900 --> 00:11:43.700
But we hadn't planned on lugging a large load like that big Zapdos.

177
00:11:43.766 --> 00:11:45.200
Hawlu.

178
00:11:45.266 --> 00:11:47.533
So, that's what this is all about.

179
00:11:47.766 --> 00:11:50.466
Now I understand why Zapdos is so angry.

180
00:11:50.533 --> 00:11:53.600
Hmph! So, we got a bit carried away.

181
00:11:55.333 --> 00:11:58.466
- Let's ask Zapdos to let us through.
- Ask?!

182
00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.000
We have to deliver medicine.

183
00:12:01.800 --> 00:12:05.566
- Are you out of your twerpish mind?
- Zapdos will listen to us.

184
00:12:05.633 --> 00:12:07.633
- Pikachu.
- This is all your fault.

185
00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:09.833
We had nothing to do with any of this.

186
00:12:10.466 --> 00:12:11.666
Let's go, everyone!

187
00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.133
- Pika!
- Hawlucha!

188
00:12:13.866 --> 00:12:16.333
Cooperation is good in this case, right?

189
00:12:16.400 --> 00:12:19.133
Right. Besides, if we split up, we're toast.

190
00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:22.166
Wait up. I don't wanna be a dumb piece of toast.

191
00:12:23.033 --> 00:12:25.066
Stay back. You'll wreck this.

192
00:12:29.266 --> 00:12:32.400
Zapdos, we're not your enemy. Let us through.

193
00:12:32.866 --> 00:12:34.233
Pika, Pika!

194
00:12:41.533 --> 00:12:45.366
We're your friends. We'll go with you to the Zapdos Festival.

195
00:12:47.366 --> 00:12:49.333
- It's no good.
- Pikachu.

196
00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.833
We're gonna have to distract it somehow.

197
00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.800
Talonflame, I choose you!

198
00:12:54.166 --> 00:12:55.600
Flame!

199
00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.033
Lead Zapdos away so we can run.

200
00:12:58.466 --> 00:12:59.633
Talon.

201
00:13:04.900 --> 00:13:05.833
Flame!

202
00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:08.633
Talonflame.

203
00:13:11.133 --> 00:13:13.366
I know you can do it, Talonflame.

204
00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:21.733
Talonflame!

205
00:13:22.800 --> 00:13:26.066
Talonflame!

206
00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:28.166
Flame!

207
00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.666
-Flame!

208
00:13:31.733 --> 00:13:32.600
Talon.

209
00:13:33.066 --> 00:13:33.900
Talonflame.

210
00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:40.666
Talonflame!

211
00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:42.933
-Talon!

212
00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:43.833
Flame!

213
00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:44.866
Talon!

214
00:13:48.733 --> 00:13:50.200
Flame!

215
00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.766
Talonflame, return.

216
00:13:59.066 --> 00:14:00.433
- Hawlucha.
- Huh?

217
00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:04.866
- Noi...
- Hawlucha.

218
00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:08.433
Noibat, let's leave this up to Hawlucha. Come on.

219
00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:09.333
Noibat.

220
00:14:09.900 --> 00:14:11.100
Noi...

221
00:14:25.866 --> 00:14:27.100
Noibat!

222
00:14:27.166 --> 00:14:28.733
Huh?! Oh, no. Noibat!

223
00:14:29.466 --> 00:14:30.966
Hawlucha!

224
00:14:39.800 --> 00:14:40.866
Noibat!

225
00:14:42.100 --> 00:14:43.233
Noibat!

226
00:14:48.266 --> 00:14:49.366
Cha?

227
00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:13.400
It evolved. Awesome.

228
00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:19.066
Noivern, the Sound Wave Pokémon.

229
00:15:19.633 --> 00:15:22.700
The ultrasonic waves Noivern releases from its ears

230
00:15:22.766 --> 00:15:25.166
are powerful enough to crush a boulder.

231
00:15:27.266 --> 00:15:29.233
Hawlucha, you were awesome.

232
00:15:29.300 --> 00:15:30.300
Noivern.

233
00:15:30.766 --> 00:15:32.266
You're sure you're good to go?

234
00:15:42.766 --> 00:15:43.700
Noivern.

235
00:15:54.933 --> 00:15:55.933
What was that?

236
00:15:56.266 --> 00:15:57.400
Pika.

237
00:15:58.433 --> 00:16:02.233
I get it now. That means Noivern's able to use Boomburst. Wow.

238
00:16:05.933 --> 00:16:07.266
Huh?

239
00:16:13.300 --> 00:16:14.533
I got a plan.

240
00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:18.900
Use the terrain! Hide behind the rocks, sneak up on Zapdos from behind

241
00:16:18.966 --> 00:16:20.766
and let him have it with Boomburst.

242
00:16:42.366 --> 00:16:43.900
All right. Boomburst, go!

243
00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:52.533
-Pika!

244
00:16:55.666 --> 00:16:59.233
And now, while the twerp's Noivern has Zapdos distracted...

245
00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:02.000
That's our cue to catch that magnificent Pokémon.

246
00:17:02.066 --> 00:17:04.966
Time to fire capture missile, stat.

247
00:17:13.266 --> 00:17:15.433
Yeah, that worked like a charm.

248
00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:17.700
Game, set, match.

249
00:17:17.766 --> 00:17:19.433
No, not Team Rocket.

250
00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:22.400
Who else could pull off such a jumbo feat?

251
00:17:22.466 --> 00:17:25.666
Snatching victory from the hands of a twerp is sweet.

252
00:17:25.733 --> 00:17:29.433
Now you can deliver that medicine using your twerpish, little feet.

253
00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.666
They make me so mad.

254
00:17:35.733 --> 00:17:38.433
Noivern, you've gotta help Zapdos!

255
00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:44.766
- Uh, what's going on, James?
- Twerpish trouble with a capital T.

256
00:17:44.833 --> 00:17:46.600
Noivern, Boomburst!

257
00:17:46.666 --> 00:17:49.233
And, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt. Let's go!

258
00:17:51.866 --> 00:17:55.633
Pikachu!

259
00:17:58.033 --> 00:18:01.300
We're blasting off again!

260
00:18:03.800 --> 00:18:06.733
Okay, Noivern, use Acrobatics to free Zapdos!

261
00:18:22.033 --> 00:18:23.233
All right!

262
00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.466
You get it now, don't you?

263
00:18:32.933 --> 00:18:35.300
Thanks, Zapdos. You're the best.

264
00:18:41.266 --> 00:18:43.600
And you're the best, too, Noivern.

265
00:18:43.666 --> 00:18:45.066
Pika, Pika!

266
00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:48.200
Lucha.

267
00:18:48.666 --> 00:18:50.666
Quick! Let's hurry up!

268
00:18:51.266 --> 00:18:52.300
- Pika!
- Run!

269
00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.333
You really helped us out.

270
00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.533
Aw, I just hope she gets better soon.

271
00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.433
See you.

272
00:19:06.933 --> 00:19:08.466
Thank you very much.

273
00:19:11.833 --> 00:19:14.766
- Okay, Pikachu. Let's go find everyone.
- Pikachu.

274
00:19:14.833 --> 00:19:16.500
- Hey, Ash!
- Hm?

275
00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:20.000
- What about the medicine?
- I just got it to the hospital.

276
00:19:20.066 --> 00:19:21.566
Yay for that!

277
00:19:22.033 --> 00:19:25.566
- So, how's Stan doing?
- There's nothing to worry about.

278
00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:28.366
Nurse Joy's helping him at this very moment.

279
00:19:28.433 --> 00:19:31.900
- Looks like Stan's going to be just fine.
- Awesome.

280
00:19:32.433 --> 00:19:33.833
Pika.

281
00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.800
Oh, yeah. Take a look at this.

282
00:19:42.366 --> 00:19:43.600
Noivern?

283
00:19:43.666 --> 00:19:45.433
You mean that your Noibat--?

284
00:19:45.500 --> 00:19:47.866
- It must have evolved.
- Right!

285
00:19:47.933 --> 00:19:50.733
I really wanted to watch it when it evolved.

286
00:19:52.600 --> 00:19:55.800
Yeah, Noivern helped us out like you wouldn't believe.

287
00:19:55.866 --> 00:19:57.033
Pika, Pika.

288
00:20:17.300 --> 00:20:19.600
Wow! Can you believe it? It's really Zapdos.

289
00:20:19.666 --> 00:20:22.233
The Zapdos Festival is about to begin.

290
00:20:22.766 --> 00:20:24.266
All right! This is gonna be fun.

291
00:20:24.333 --> 00:20:26.733
- I've been waiting for this.
- Me, too.

292
00:20:31.366 --> 00:20:34.333
After helping the Legendary Pokémon Zapdos,

293
00:20:34.400 --> 00:20:37.333
Ash and the rest of our heroes are finally able

294
00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:39.200
to enjoy the Zapdos Festival.

295
00:20:39.266 --> 00:20:44.200
And, to add to the excitement, Noibat has evolved into Noivern.

296
00:20:44.266 --> 00:20:46.966
As the journey continues.
